---
/**
 * EU institutions and the ordinary legislative procedure (CJD Bach, unit 2).
 *
 * Two readings in one figure: the institutional triangle at the top (who
 * proposes, who co-decides, who interprets) and the procedure as a strip
 * below it, so the role-play in this unit's learning situation can be
 * followed on the diagram while it happens.
 */
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 820 520" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Instituciones de la Unión Europea y procedimiento legislativo ordinario">
  <title>Quién decide en la Unión Europea</title>
  <desc>
    Arriba, el triángulo institucional: la Comisión Europea propone, y el Parlamento
    Europeo y el Consejo de la Unión Europea codeciden. El Consejo Europeo marca la
    orientación política y el Tribunal de Justicia interpreta. Abajo, el procedimiento
    legislativo ordinario en cuatro pasos: propuesta de la Comisión, primera lectura
    del Parlamento, posición del Consejo y adopción o segunda lectura.
  </desc>
  <defs>
    <style>
      .bg { fill: #FBF6EC; }
      .inst { stroke-width: 2; }
      .i-com { fill: #E0DCF0; stroke: #4A3B8F; }
      .i-par { fill: #DBEDED; stroke: #1F6E6E; }
      .i-con { fill: #FBE3D6; stroke: #C44E2C; }
      .i-sec { fill: #F5EDD9; stroke: #8A7868; stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
      .name { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; fill: #2A1F18; text-anchor: middle; }
      .role { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px; fill: #5C4A3D; text-anchor: middle; }
      .who { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-style: italic; fill: #8A7868; text-anchor: middle; }
      .verb { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; fill: #C44E2C; text-anchor: middle; }
      .arrow { fill: none; stroke: #C44E2C; stroke-width: 1.8; marker-end: url(#ue-arrow); }
      .arrow-soft { fill: none; stroke: #8A7868; stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; marker-end: url(#ue-arrow-soft); }
      .step { fill: #FFFFFF; stroke: #4A3B8F; stroke-width: 1.6; }
      .step-n { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; fill: #4A3B8F; text-anchor: middle; }
      .step-t { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: #2A1F18; text-anchor: middle; }
      .step-d { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 9.5px; fill: #5C4A3D; text-anchor: middle; }
      .band { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase; fill: #8A7868; }
    </style>
    <marker id="ue-arrow" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="9" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 10 3, 0 6" fill="#C44E2C" />
    </marker>
    <marker id="ue-arrow-soft" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="9" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 10 3, 0 6" fill="#8A7868" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <rect class="bg" x="0" y="0" width="820" height="520" />

  <text class="band" x="40" y="30">El triángulo institucional</text>

  <!-- Commission -->
  <rect class="inst i-com" x="310" y="48" width="200" height="76" rx="4" />
  <text class="name" x="410" y="76">Comisión Europea</text>
  <text class="role" x="410" y="96">Propone la norma</text>
  <text class="who" x="410" y="114">Un comisario por Estado · defiende el interés común</text>

  <!-- Parliament -->
  <rect class="inst i-par" x="60" y="188" width="220" height="88" rx="4" />
  <text class="name" x="170" y="216">Parlamento Europeo</text>
  <text class="role" x="170" y="236">Codecide y controla</text>
  <text class="who" x="170" y="254">Elegido cada 5 años</text>
  <text class="who" x="170" y="270">por la ciudadanía</text>

  <!-- Council of the EU -->
  <rect class="inst i-con" x="540" y="188" width="220" height="88" rx="4" />
  <text class="name" x="650" y="216">Consejo de la UE</text>
  <text class="role" x="650" y="236">Codecide</text>
  <text class="who" x="650" y="254">Los ministros de cada</text>
  <text class="who" x="650" y="270">Estado, por materias</text>

  <path class="arrow" d="M 330 128 L 200 184" />
  <path class="arrow" d="M 490 128 L 620 184" />
  <text class="verb" x="250" y="150">propone</text>
  <text class="verb" x="572" y="150">propone</text>

  <path class="arrow" d="M 288 226 L 532 226" />
  <path class="arrow" d="M 532 244 L 288 244" />
  <text class="verb" x="410" y="218">codecisión</text>

  <!-- Secondary institutions -->
  <rect class="inst i-sec" x="60" y="316" width="220" height="64" rx="4" />
  <text class="name" x="170" y="342">Consejo Europeo</text>
  <text class="role" x="170" y="362">Jefes de Estado o de Gobierno.</text>
  <text class="role" x="170" y="376">Marca la orientación, no legisla.</text>

  <rect class="inst i-sec" x="540" y="316" width="220" height="64" rx="4" />
  <text class="name" x="650" y="342">Tribunal de Justicia</text>
  <text class="role" x="650" y="362">Interpreta el Derecho de la Unión</text>
  <text class="role" x="650" y="376">y garantiza que se aplique igual.</text>

  <path class="arrow-soft" d="M 170 310 L 170 282" />
  <path class="arrow-soft" d="M 650 310 L 650 282" />

  <!-- Ordinary legislative procedure -->
  <text class="band" x="40" y="418">Procedimiento legislativo ordinario</text>

  <rect class="step" x="40" y="432" width="168" height="62" rx="4" />
  <text class="step-n" x="64" y="462">1</text>
  <text class="step-t" x="132" y="456">Propuesta</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="132" y="472">La Comisión redacta</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="132" y="486">y presenta el texto</text>

  <rect class="step" x="228" y="432" width="168" height="62" rx="4" />
  <text class="step-n" x="252" y="462">2</text>
  <text class="step-t" x="320" y="456">Primera lectura</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="320" y="472">El Parlamento enmienda</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="320" y="486">y fija su posición</text>

  <rect class="step" x="416" y="432" width="168" height="62" rx="4" />
  <text class="step-n" x="440" y="462">3</text>
  <text class="step-t" x="508" y="456">Posición del Consejo</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="508" y="472">Los ministros aprueban</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="508" y="486">o devuelven el texto</text>

  <rect class="step" x="604" y="432" width="176" height="62" rx="4" />
  <text class="step-n" x="628" y="462">4</text>
  <text class="step-t" x="700" y="456">Adopción</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="700" y="472">Si coinciden, se adopta;</text>
  <text class="step-d" x="700" y="486">si no, segunda lectura</text>

  <path class="arrow" d="M 210 463 L 224 463" />
  <path class="arrow" d="M 398 463 L 412 463" />
  <path class="arrow" d="M 586 463 L 600 463" />
</svg>
